{
  "title": "3rd Day",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \r\nاَللّٰهُمَ ارْزُقْنِیْ فِيْهِ الذِّهْنَ وَالتَّنْبِیْهَ وَبَاعِدْ نِیْ فِیْهِ مِنَ السَّفَاهَۃِ وَ التَّمْوِیْهِ وَ اجْعَلْ لِیْ نَصِیْبًا مِنْ كُلِّ خَیْرٍ تُنْزِلُ فِیْهِ بِجُوْدِكَ یَا اَجْوَدَ الْاَجْوَدِیْنَ.\r\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\r\nALLAAHUMMAR ZUQNEE FEEHIZ ZEHNA WAT TAMBEEHA WA BAA-I’DNE FEEHE MENAS SAFAAHATE WAT-TAMWEEHE WAJ-A’L LEE NASEEBAN MIN KULLE KHAYRIN TUNZELO FEEHE BE-JOODEKA YAA AJWADAL AJWADEENA.\r\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\r\nO Allah! In this holy month, make me wise and alert on my sins. Keep me away, in this month from ignorance and ostentations. Award me a share from all the blessings that You may bestow in this month. I refer You to Your Kindness and Benevolence. O the most Benevolent of all benevolent!"
}
